{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01200",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.97,
      "end_seconds": 3.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Hello, come in. Mind the step."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.31,
      "end_seconds": 6.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.12,
      "text": "Hi, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.25,
      "end_seconds": 8.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "What's been worrying you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.74,
      "end_seconds": 16.99,
      "duration_seconds": 6.25,
      "text": "So the thing is, uh, I've got a lingering cough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.06,
      "end_seconds": 22.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "What's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.14,
      "end_seconds": 25.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Ever since... since Monday, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.06,
      "end_seconds": 34.96,
      "duration_seconds": 7.9,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.65,
      "end_seconds": 64.55,
      "duration_seconds": 25.9,
      "text": "It happens a few times a day. A eight out of ten, I suppose. It settles a little with honey. It's worse with cold air. And there's a tickle in my throat as well, about four days now. About tickle in my throat, pretty severe, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.54,
      "end_seconds": 70.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.99,
      "end_seconds": 76.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "I've had arthritis in my knees, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.19,
      "end_seconds": 79.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.34,
      "end_seconds": 103.7,
      "duration_seconds": 22.36,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions. I smoke roughly a pack every two days. I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling. No, I share a house with my brother. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.6,
      "end_seconds": 109.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "What do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.59,
      "end_seconds": 128.29,
      "duration_seconds": 17.7,
      "text": "I take diclofenac, 50 milligrams, when needed. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't. Before this I was on paracetamol; that's been stopped."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.42,
      "end_seconds": 132.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "Before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.1,
      "end_seconds": 136.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "I've never had an allergy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.87,
      "end_seconds": 140.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.47,
      "end_seconds": 145.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "My uncle has high cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.87,
      "end_seconds": 151.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "a few quick ones: weight loss or shortness of breath?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.02,
      "end_seconds": 154.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "No, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.06,
      "end_seconds": 158.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "did you get coughing up blood or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.86,
      "end_seconds": 164.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.69,
      "text": "I haven't had coughing up blood or fever, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.61,
      "end_seconds": 169.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Any muscle or joint problems besides this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.13,
      "end_seconds": 172.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "Nothing else aches."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.11,
      "end_seconds": 177.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "Alright, how about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.65,
      "end_seconds": 183.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "No, that's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 197.84,
      "end_seconds": 207.43,
      "duration_seconds": 9.59,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Saturation 99 percent, respiratory rate 18, temp 36.7 degrees, pressure 110 over 81, heart rate 85."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.72,
      "end_seconds": 210.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "alright, good, thank you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.78,
      "end_seconds": 213.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "Shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.73,
      "end_seconds": 217.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.08,
      "end_seconds": 239.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "Your chest is clear and your oxygen is normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.04,
      "end_seconds": 244.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.08,
      "end_seconds": 261.91,
      "duration_seconds": 6.83,
      "text": "Putting it all together, this looks most like a post-viral cough that is settling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 263.05,
      "end_seconds": 266.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.48,
      "end_seconds": 287.23,
      "duration_seconds": 19.75,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a post-viral cough that is settling, and we'll watch how it goes. Just to be sure I understood. You've had a lingering cough, since Monday, and no coughing up blood or shortness of breath."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 288.48,
      "end_seconds": 290.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "mm, that's right"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.26,
      "end_seconds": 315.1,
      "duration_seconds": 11.84,
      "text": "It should settle over the next two to three weeks; steam and honey can help. I'd like to see you again if it lasts beyond eight weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 320.42,
      "end_seconds": 322.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Okay, I'll arrange it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 324.45,
      "end_seconds": 327.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 328.93,
      "end_seconds": 332.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "Right, I'll do that. Thank you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.65,
      "end_seconds": 336.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "Take care now."
    }
  ]
}